[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16983.39, "timestamp": "04:43:03", "text": "儿子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16987.47, "timestamp": "04:43:07", "text": "枪。存活。战胜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16991.75, "timestamp": "04:43:11", "text": "我。就让他鼓起勇气去决斗吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16993.99, "timestamp": "04:43:13", "text": "是的，因为如果你想看到类似这样的情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16995.83, "timestamp": "04:43:15", "text": "本游戏中的决斗者列表，这很……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16998.59, "timestamp": "04:43:18", "text": "荒谬至极。所以，我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17001.868, "timestamp": "04:43:21", "text": "更多的坦克，更多的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17006.07, "timestamp": "04:43:26", "text": "我们该怎么称呼它呢？更多治疗师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17008.948, "timestamp": "04:43:28", "text": "因为你看，看看他们是否会添加……嗯，那是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17013.83, "timestamp": "04:43:33", "text": "他叫什么名字？呃，呃，他叫什么名字？他妈的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17015.67, "timestamp": "04:43:35", "text": "他叫什么名字？哦，死侍。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17017.27, "timestamp": "04:43:37", "text": "是的。是的。如果他们喜欢添加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17019.75, "timestamp": "04:43:39", "text": "我希望死侍能成为一名治疗师。"}]